  "content": "\n\n<p><span><strong>Create: Oxidized&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p><span>这是一个为 Create 模组添加铜氧化配方的附加组件。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/850/860/oxidized_logo.png\" alt=\"Create: Oxidized 标志\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong>内容：&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span>所有铜质建筑方块的淋滤配方</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/850/859/oxidized_recipes.png\" alt=\"配方合集\" width=\"782\" height=\"333\"></span></p>\n<p><span><strong>常见问题：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span><strong>何时推出 1.xx 版本？</strong></span></p>\n<p><span>目前仅支持 1.20.1、1.19.2 和 1.18.2，我们暂无计划为该模组制作更旧版本的适配。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fSieyva\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/f145a138-ea20-40c4-8c87-33fe627bd905.webp\" alt=\"使用优惠码 Sieyva 在 Bisect Hosting 享受 25% 折扣\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></span></p>",
